      "name": "DOME Observatory corpus, 2026-09 release",
      "dct:title": "DOME Observatory corpus, 2026-09 release",
      "description": "Release 2026-09 of the DOME Observatory corpus: 846,716 publications from Europe PMC screened against the DOME Observatory curation criteria, 366,234 of them classified as AI/ML methods papers (473,503 not, 6,979 undeterminable). 3,332 carry controlled-vocabulary enrichment (EDAM domains, learning paradigm, model family, model type) and 311,025 link to research outputs such as deposited data, software and DOME Registry entries. Record schema v1.6.0.",
